# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock for the embed-as-library example crate (#372). The example
# crate opts itself out of the workspace via `[workspace]` and cargo
# regenerates the lockfile on `cargo build` — committing it would just
# create churn.
crates/zfb-server/examples/embed/Cargo.lock

# Node
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Test-fixture node_modules — the pnpm-workspace-consumer fixture
# (`crates/zfb-islands/fixtures/pnpm-workspace-consumer/`) keeps its
# workspace package source under `workspace/zfb-blog-islands/` and the
# integration test wires up
# `node_modules/@takazudo/zfb-blog-islands` as a symlink at runtime
# (post codex-review fix on PR #125 — the scanner now requires the
# pnpm symlink shape before descending into a bare specifier). The
# global `node_modules/` rule above already keeps that runtime symlink
# out of git, so we no longer need a fixture whitelist.

# Editors
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Worktrees (managed by /x-wt-teams)
worktrees/

# Bundled third-party binaries (populated by release engineering, never committed)
crates/zfb/binaries/tailwindcss-v4
crates/zfb/binaries/tailwindcss-v4.exe
crates/zfb/binaries/tailwindcss-v4.tmp
crates/zfb/binaries/esbuild/esbuild

# Ephemeral / temp files (e.g. agent prompts, review diffs)
__inbox/

# Locally-downloaded dev tool binaries (e.g. actionlint for linting
# GitHub Actions workflows) — never committed.
/actionlint

# Claude Code scheduler session state (CronCreate / scheduled tasks).
# Per-session lock + job store — never committed.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json

# Per-project zfb cache (graph snapshot, etc.) — created in user
# project roots when `zfb dev` runs. Never committed.
.zfb/

# Build intermediates from `zfb build` / `zfb dev` — the SSR worker
# bundle (`bundle.mjs` + `bundle.mjs.map`) the renderer loads.
# Relocated out of `dist/.zfb-build/` (zfb#231) into the project root
# so it doesn't ship to deploy uploads. Created in user project roots
# and in any local zfb project (e.g. a standalone demo repo).
# Never committed.
.zfb-build/

# Stale renderer bootstrap files left at workspace root when the
# miniflare subprocess is killed before NamedTempFile drop runs
# (e.g. SIGKILL). See crates/zfb-build/src/renderer.rs.
/zfb-renderer-bootstrap-*.mjs

# Release archives + checksums produced locally by
# scripts/build-macos-x64-local.sh (issue #437 escape hatch). Uploaded to the
# GH Release, never committed.
/zfb-*.tar.gz
/zfb-*.tar.gz.sha256

# Native binary copied into the per-platform npm packages during release
# builds (scripts/build-macos-x64-local.sh, release.yml). Downloaded from the
# GH Release at publish time — never committed. Only LICENSE/README/package.json
# are tracked in these packages.
/packages/zfb-*/zfb
/packages/zfb-*/zfb.exe
